  "css_summary": "【抽出カラー（頻度順）】\n  #E60000  color  出現379回  [external-css]\n  #333333  color  出現149回  [external-css]\n  #D4D4D4  border  出現75回  [external-css]\n  #DCDCDC  border-left  出現68回  [external-css]\n  #DDDDDD  border-top  出現57回  [external-css]\n  #5A5A5A  color  出現43回  [external-css]\n  #CCCCCC  background  出現35回  [external-css]\n  #999999  color  出現32回  [external-css]\n  #EEEEEE  background-color  出現32回  [external-css]\n  #666666  color  出現31回  [external-css]\n  #F2F2F2  background-color  出現28回  [external-css]\n  #F2D6C5  background  出現23回  [external-css]\n  #F5F5F5  background  出現20回  [external-css]\n  #F7F7F7  background  出現15回  [external-css]\n  #E6E6E6  border-color  出現14回  [external-css]\n\n【使用フォント】\n  Graphik\n  ヒラギノ角ゴ Pro\n  Arial\n  slick\n  Hiragino Kaku Gothic Pro\n  helvetica\n\n【角丸パターン】\n  4px\n  50%\n  5px\n  3px\n  5px 5px 0 0\n  0 4px 4px 0px / 0 4px 4px 0px\n  6px\n  13px\n\n【ボタンスタイル】\n  ★ .a-btn.a-btn_bg-gray（実際のボタン要素で2回使用）\n    color: #fff\n    font-size: 1.6rem\n    display: block\n    border: 1px solid #d4d4d4\n    border-radius: 3px\n    padding: 15px 35px\n  ★ .a-btn.a-btn_bg-red.a-btn-newwin（実際のボタン要素で1回使用）\n    color: #fff\n    padding-left: auto\n    padding-right: 38px\n    height: auto\n    font-size: 1.6rem\n    display: inline-block\n  ★ .a-btn（実際のボタン要素で22回使用）\n    font-size: 1.6rem\n    color: #333\n    display: block\n    border: 1px solid #d4d4d4\n    border-radius: 3px\n    padding: 15px 35px\n  ★ .a-btn.a-btn-newwin（実際のボタン要素で4回使用）\n    height: auto\n    padding-right: 38px\n    font-size: 1.6rem\n    color: #333\n    display: inline-block\n    border: 1px solid #d4d4d4\n  ★ .a-btn.a-btn-small.a-btn-newwin（実際のボタン要素で1回使用）\n    height: auto\n    padding-right: 30px\n    font-size: 1.2rem\n    color: #333\n    display: inline-block\n    border: 1px solid #d4d4d4\n\n【カードスタイル】\n  main.communication .mv .info .box .anchor-list>a\n    font-size: 1.4rem\n    padding: 4px 18px 4px 6px\n    margin: 0 0 5px 5px\n  .sec3-ob .inner .sec3-center .box\n    padding: 10px\n  .sec3-ob .inner .sec3-center .box:nth-of-type(1)\n    background: #e60000\n  .sec3-ob .inner .sec3-center .box:nth-of-type(2)\n    background: #5a5a5a\n  .sec3-ob .inner .sec3-center .box h3\n    color: #fff\n    font-size: 1.8rem\n\n【フォームスタイル】\n  .m-input\n    color: #333\n    font-size: 1.6rem\n    font-weight: 100\n    display: block\n    padding: 10px\n    width: 100%\n  .m-inputfile_label\n    text-align: center\n    display: block\n    background-color: white\n    border: 1px solid #d1d1d1\n    border-radius: 5px\n    -webkit-box-shadow: 0 1px 1px rgba(148, 148, 148, .25)\n  .m-radiobtn_input:checked + .m-radiobtn_text:after\n    display: block\n    width: 10px\n    height: 10px\n    background-color: #e60000\n    border-radius: 50%\n  textarea.m-input::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb\n    background-color: #c1c1c1\n    border-radius: 4px\n  .m-selectmenu:before\n    width: 20px\n    height: 100%\n    background-color: #e60000\n    border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0px / 0 4px 4px 0px\n\n【ロゴ・ビジュアル素材】\n  https://www.mufg.jp/dam/cmn/og_image.jpg\n  https://www.mufg.jp/favicon_ja.ico\n  https://www.mufg.jp/dam/cmn/cmn_logo_mufg_001.png\n  https://www.mufg.jp/dam/cmn/imgs/logo-20th.svg\n  https://www.mufg.jp/dam/cmn/cmn_logo_mufg_003.png\n  https://www.mufg.jp/dam/brand/toppage/images/our-brand/main_sp.jpg\n  https://www.mufg.jp/dam/brand/toppage/images/our-brand/main.jpg\n  https://www.mufg.jp/dam/brand/toppage/images/our-brand/se1-img1.png\n  https://www.mufg.jp/dam/brand/toppage/images/our-brand/sp/sec3-img01.png\n  https://www.mufg.jp/dam/brand/toppage/images/our-brand/sp/sec4-img1.png\n\n【取得CSSファイル】\n  https://www.mufg.jp/etc.clientlibs/mufg/clientlibs/clientlib-base.css\n  https://www.mufg.jp/etc.clientlibs/mufg/clientlibs/mufg-page.css\n  https://www.mufg.jp/etc.clientlibs/mufg/clientlibs/mufg-page.min.css\n  https://www.mufg.jp/dam/brand/toppage/css/mufg-way.css\n  https://www.mufg.jp/dam/brand/toppage/css/mufg-ob.css\n  https://www.mufg.jp/